  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PPG: Transforming Nauru&#x2019;s Food Systems through Climate Smart Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: &#x201c;Transforming Nauru&#x2019;s Food Systems through Climate Smart Agriculture&#x201d;. As described in the child project concept note of the Food Systems Integrated Program (FSIP), this project aims to implement Nauru&#x2019;s Climate Smart Agriculture Plan (NaCSAP) to contribute to food and nutrition security. NaCSAP is a holistic, island-wide approach that is vertically integrated and coordinated through a whole-of-government platfor</narrative>
  </description>
